== Filming location ==
Lindisfarne Castle has been used as a filming location including; ''[[Cul-de-sac (1966 film)|Cul-de-sac]]'' (1966);{{citation needed|date=January 2023}} ''[[Macbeth (1971 film)|The Tragedy of Macbeth]]'' (1971);<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.bbc.co.uk/tyne/content/articles/2006/04/13/hollywood_on_tyne_macbeth_feature.shtml |title=Macbeth |access-date=7 February 2024 |publisher=[[BBC Tyne]]}}</ref> ''[[Cold Feet]]'' (1998–2003);<ref>Tibballs, Geoff (2000). ''Cold Feet: The Best Bits…''. London: Granada Media: p.&nbsp;211. {{ISBN|0-233-99924-8}}.</ref> ''[[The Scarlet Pimpernel (1982 film)|The Scarlet Pimpernel]]'' (1982);{{citation needed|date=January 2023}} ''[[Wolfblood]]''{{citation needed|date=January 2023}} and ''[[Reign (TV series)|Reign]]''.{{citation needed|date=January 2023}}

